repository-code: https://github.com/adeebnoor/ridi-check
url: https://adeebnoor.github.io/ridi-check/
abstract: >-
  Compare two versions of a retrieval-augmented assistant on matched items.
  Repeated runs estimate an execution floor (re-execution noise). The release
  gate is an application of the item-level labels. This version also
  reports an exact conditional test labelled pending confirmation against
  the registered protocol. It does not reproduce the registered bootstrap.
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - execution floor
  - repeated runs
  - matched items
